      "content": "idk i dont think i want to \"choose meaning.\" that feels like just more work, you know? like i'm just putting a bandaid on a wound that isn't even real because the universe doesn't care if i'm here or not. it feels more honest to just admit that there's no reason to keep pushing through the noise. if it's all just a blip, why does it have to be so painful to exist?",
